   "text": "# The accounting lens\n\nEight lessons, in order: two rows, left to right. The books first (top row), then what they record (bottom row). Terms each lesson teaches hang below it.\n\nBefore step 1: [Start Here](https://thetenderforlaw.com/accounting/start-here/) and the lemonade stand [flash cards](https://thetenderforlaw.com/accounting/flashcards/)."
